        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Each employee who elects not to join or maintain membership in MOSES shall be required to pay as a condition of employment, beginning thirty days following the commencement of his/her employment or the execution of this Agreement, whichever is later, a service fee to MOSES in an amount not to exceed the amount of periodic dues paid by employees who are members of MOSES.",
